      "review_summary": "This PR rewrites the bounded TranscriptsStore JSONL reader to event listeners, adds a stream-error regression test, and adds a proof script for a directory-as-file read error.\n\nPR surface: Source +21, Tests +33, Other +53. Total +107 across 3 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. at source level: the PR test and proof exercise stream/read errors, and current main rethrows non-ENOENT bounded read failures after cleanup. I did not run a live gateway crash reproduction in this read-only review.",
